# Advisory context filter for Claude Code — NOT a hard security boundary.
# Claude Code already skips .gitignore'd paths for its Glob/Grep tools,
# so most of the real work is done there. Use this file only for things
# you want out of routine context but that aren't build artifacts
# (so they don't belong in .gitignore), e.g. large historical docs.

docs/archive/
*.generated.*
CHANGELOG.md

# Do NOT rely on this alone for secrets. Use .gitignore + your OS
# permissions + .claude/settings.json permissions.deny for anything
# that actually needs to be blocked, not just filtered.
